+---
+id: task-002-rental-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Rental availability query"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Rental availability query
+
+Add `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to the rental service. It returns the sorted ids of the equipment
+of that kind (any kind when `kind` is omitted) that is free for the whole period.
+
+## Acceptance
+
+- The period is validated like `quote`/`book` (midnight UTC, end after start); invalid periods throw.
+- An item with a booking overlapping the period is excluded; adjacent bookings do not exclude it.
+- `kind` filters; an unknown `kind` throws.
+- Ids are returned sorted.
